{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Send me, for the dawn has risen.</b> Until now I have held you back, and from now on you have permission to go. Another interpretation: <b>for the dawn has risen</b> — and you need not worry, for it is not the way of harmful beings to be seen by day." "<b>For unless you bless me.</b> And then I will be certain that you will not harbor enmity. And you will not harm me for having wrestled with you."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:09.016294225Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}